# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr "[Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/) を読んで、ソルバー・ジョブのノード数、ランク数、スレッド数を選択してください。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"for the configuration file, the solvers, and the run parameters.\n"
msgstr "[SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd) を読んで、設定ファイル、ソルバー、実行パラメーターについて確認してください。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [QRMI sampler on Slurm](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_qrmi_slurm_sampler/)\n"
"for the QRMI worker and the layout of `qrmi_config.json`.\n"
msgstr "[QRMI sampler on Slurm](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_qrmi_slurm_sampler/) を読んで、QRMI ワーカーと `qrmi_config.json` のレイアウトについて確認してください。\n"
